sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Harness: pnpm dev:sign-in or e2e signIn
  participant A as App, local host only
  participant M as Mailpit API

  H->>M: note the address's existing message IDs
  H->>A: POST /api/auth/sign-in/magic-link, as the sign-in page does
  A-->>H: { status: true }
  A->>M: sign-in email, after the response
  H->>M: wait for a new message to the address
  M-->>H: plain text: "Sign-in link: …", "Sign-in code: …"
  H->>A: GET /api/auth/magic-link/verify?token=…<br/>same-origin fetch headers, as the confirm page does
  A-->>H: { ok: true } and the session cookies
  H->>H: save .dev/auth/email.json or add cookies to the test context
